{
  "version": 1,
  "defaultSuite": "smoke",
  "suites": {
    "smoke": [
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 3000 },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "!/加载失败|拿不到|接口返回/.test(document.body.innerText)",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "首页不能一上来就是错误态——真出错时这条会红，比截图上人眼看更早发现"
      },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "document.querySelectorAll('[data-row-id]').length >= 5",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "推荐流至少渲染出 5 行（虚拟列表只渲可见区，所以不检查全量条数）"
      },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "[...document.querySelectorAll('img')].some(i => i.src.startsWith('applet://localhost/image/'))",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "封面必须走 applet://image/ —— 裸 https 会被 CSP 静默拦成空白，这条是唯一能自动逮到的地方"
      },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "/观看/.test(document.body.innerText)",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "播放量格式化生效（formatCount）"
      },
      {
        "action": "eval",
        "expr": "(() => { const b = [...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(x => x.textContent.trim() === '排行榜'); if (!b) throw new Error('排行榜 segment not found'); b.click(); return 'ok' })()"
      },
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 2500 },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "document.querySelectorAll('[data-row-id]').length >= 5",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "切到排行榜后仍有内容（排行榜走的是另一个免签端点）"
      },
      {
        "action": "eval",
        "expr": "(() => { const b = [...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(x => x.textContent.trim() === '搜索'); if (!b) throw new Error('搜索 tab not found'); b.click(); return 'ok' })()"
      },
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
      {
        "action": "eval",
        "expr": "(() => { const i = document.querySelector('input'); if (!i) throw new Error('search input not found'); const setter = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(window.HTMLInputElement.prototype, 'value').set; setter.call(i, '编程'); i.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true })); const b = [...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(x => x.textContent.trim() === '搜索'); b.click(); return 'ok' })()",
        "note": "受控 input 必须用原生 setter 再派发 input 事件，直接改 .value 不会触发 React 的 onChange"
      },
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 3500 },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "/视频/.test(document.body.innerText) && document.querySelectorAll('[data-row-id]').length >= 3",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "搜索出结果 —— 这条同时验证了 WBI 签名是对的（签错会回 -403，结果为空）"
      },
      {
        "action": "eval",
        "expr": "(() => { const r = document.querySelector('[data-row-id]'); if (!r) throw new Error('无搜索结果行'); r.click(); return 'ok' })()",
        "note": "先进入详情，再从根 Tab 切走；这才覆盖用户遇到的『我的已选中但详情仍覆盖』"
      },
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 2500 },
      {
        "action": "eval",
        "expr": "(() => { const b = [...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(x => x.textContent.trim() === '我的'); if (!b) throw new Error('我的 tab not found'); b.click(); return 'ok' })()"
      },
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 2500 },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "/播放设置/.test(document.body.innerText) && !/相关推荐/.test(document.body.innerText)",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "切根 Tab 必须清空详情子页栈，而不是只把原生选中态换成『我的』"
      },
      {
        "action": "eval",
        "expr": "(() => { const b = [...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(x => x.textContent.trim() === '扫码登录'); if (!b) throw new Error('登录按钮未找到'); b.click(); return 'ok' })()"
      },
      { "action": "wait", "ms": 5000 },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "[...document.querySelectorAll('img')].some(i => i.src.startsWith('applet://localhost/qr/'))",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "二维码画出来了。这条钉的是一个静默失败：登录接口在 passport.bilibili.com 而不是 api.bilibili.com，写错域名会拿到 HTTP 404 的 HTML 页（不是 JSON 错误码），报错信息指向不明"
      },
      {
        "action": "assert",
        "expr": "!/拿不到二维码/.test(document.body.innerText)",
        "matcher": "truthy",
        "note": "同上的反向断言：出错时页面会显示「拿不到二维码」"
      }
    ]
  }
}

